    "role": "Qliphothic Weather (Gamaliel — Greater)",
    "tier": 4,
    "factionId": "",
    "notes": "<p>Not a single creature but a sentient psychic weather system — the collective filth of a billion nightmares given form. A slow-rolling bank of sickly purple, grey and black fog covering a huge area, within which the most repressed, obscene, violent fantasies of mortal minds are made terrifyingly real: a distorted screaming face here, a grasping claw of teeth there, a weeping eye the size of a boulder. A walking zone of madness. A living dream from which there is no awakening — only weathering it.</p><p><strong>Qliphah:</strong> Gamaliel, the Obscenities — the Hull of Yesod. The sewer under the Foundation, risen to street level.</p><p><em>Mal's note: 'It is a landscape that happens to be hungry, and it is ALWAYS your own id catering the buffet. Rope-line your people together and do not trust anything you are ashamed of wanting.'</em></p>",
